File Eof 1640..1640 ""
  members: ModuleDoc ModuleDocComment 0..95 "//! A function written as an argument, a closure or not, takes the types of its parameters from"
  members: ModuleDoc ModuleDocComment 96..190 "//! what the call expects of it: a function type, or the `lang.ops.Call` constraint of the `$`"
  members: ModuleDoc ModuleDocComment 191..290 "//! parameter it binds, once the other arguments, and what the call is expected to give, have fixed"
  members: ModuleDoc ModuleDocComment 291..385 "//! what that names. A result is that constraint's where it says one, and the type of the body"
  members: ModuleDoc ModuleDocComment 386..459 "//! otherwise, for a bare function as for a closure (spec 01, section 4)."
